le argue that abliterated AI models threaten national security and need regulation. \n\nBut think about this. \n\nHackers use leaked API keys of frontier AI and jailbreak them to launch attacks. \n\nBy that logic, should we ban frontier AI entirely so nobody can use it?","url":"https://x.com/jun_song/status/2112446089949589890"},{"author_id":"61822673","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:26:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112249039240716412"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/fchollet/statu…","end":302,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/fchollet/status/2110775560846914009","start":279,"url":"https://t.co/ma9dQZFunx"}]},"id":"2112249039240716412","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":501,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Earlier this year, the best frontier AI models made little headway on the ARC-AGI-3 benchmark. Today, we’re seeing multiple models pushing the frontier. AI won’t wait for Congress to catch up – we need to get sensible regulations in place, while incentivizing the private sector https://t.co/ma9dQZFunx","url":"https://x.com/sliccardo/status/2112249039240716412"},{"author_id":"2075328977594675200","created_at":"2026-10-20T03:50:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112391081438429355"],"id":"2112391081438429355","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":37,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"[VELVET WATERS' Take]\n\nJapan's ruling party now calls the wave of cyberattacks a national \"emergency.\"\n\n▼ What's proposed (per reports)\n・A response HQ led by the Prime Minister's Office, ending ministry silos\n・NCO (National Cybersecurity Office) gets legal power to direct all","url":"https://x.com/VELVETWATERS358/status/2112391081438429355"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112573647504183297"]},"author_id":"368621253","created_at":"2026-10-20T18:30:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112612311638610067"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"p